# A resume that is not a resume: joining resets the durable cursor.
MODULE: InFlightRemediationKeptJoinRestarts
TARGET: InFlightRemediationKept
CLASS: Action
SUMMARY: a start that joins the in-flight remediation restarts it from its first value
PERTURBS: Accept

--- FIND
            /\ UNCHANGED <<opOutcome, remInProgress, remOwner, remParams,
                           remPhase, remCursor>>
       ELSE /\ opWork' = [opWork EXCEPT ![o] = "Done"]
--- REPLACE
            /\ remPhase' = "DryRun" /\ remCursor' = 0
            /\ UNCHANGED <<opOutcome, remInProgress, remOwner, remParams>>
       ELSE /\ opWork' = [opWork EXCEPT ![o] = "Done"]
--- END
